It downloads and uses the following third-party models at runtime. They are not
included in this repository; each keeps its own license:

- Whisper large-v3-turbo (OpenAI, MIT), CTranslate2 conversion by
  dropbox-dash/faster-whisper-large-v3-turbo (MIT)
- Whisper small (OpenAI, MIT), CTranslate2 conversion by Systran/faster-whisper-small (MIT)
- Silero VAD v6.2.1 (Silero Team, MIT)
- NVIDIA NeMo TitaNet-L speaker embedding (CC-BY-4.0), ONNX export by the
  sherpa-onnx project (k2-fsa)
- WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM speaker embedding, trained on VoxCeleb (CC-BY-4.0), ONNX export
  by the sherpa-onnx project (k2-fsa)
- Pocket TTS Turkish by wite-tech (CC-BY-4.0), based on Kyutai Pocket TTS
- Kyutai Pocket TTS (CC-BY-4.0); built-in voice embeddings from
  kyutai/pocket-tts-without-voice-cloning. Voice sources (kyutai/tts-voices): alba (CC-BY-4.0,
  the default English voice), VCTK voices such as anna, eve, george (CC-BY-4.0),
  voice-donations and voice-zero voices (CC0). The "cosette" (Expresso) and "jean" (EARS)
  voices are NON-COMMERCIAL only (CC-BY-NC-4.0).

Key Python libraries: faster-whisper (MIT), CTranslate2 (MIT), sherpa-onnx
(Apache-2.0), ONNX Runtime (MIT), PyTorch (BSD-3-Clause), pocket-tts (MIT),
pocket-tts-turkish (Apache-2.0), FastAPI (MIT), MCP Python SDK (MIT).
